      "widgets_values": [
        "SHOWCASE 05 — STUDIO BACKGROUND REPLACEMENT\nBased on the supplied complex Paint + Layout + SAM + InvertMask + Restore example. Flow: subject IMAGE -> Layout Cell (position/scale) -> Layout Composer (target studio canvas) -> SAM 3.1 person + hair union -> InvertMask (paint everything EXCEPT the subject) -> Paint Prepare -> AnyPaint -> sampling -> Paint Restore. Preserve the subject while replacing the background. Change Layout Cell placement and Mask text prompts to adapt. The reference image and subject masks are inspectable. Boost is not used for Paint."
      ],
